It used to open several doors in the [[Kazordoon]], most notably the entrance to the [[Colossus Fortress]]. The doors which this key opened were the following:
* Colossus Fortress entrance, {{Mapper Coords|127.79|124.158|8|8|text=here}}
* Main entrance guard west tower, {{Mapper Coords|127.62|124.193|9|8|text=here}}
* Main entrance guard west tower, {{Mapper Coords|127.64|124.195|9|8|text=here}}
* Main entrance guard east tower, {{Mapper Coords|127.69|124.195|9|8|text=here}}
* Entrance Fortress tower, {{Mapper Coords|127.68|124.205|6|8|text=here}}

It is unknown if copies of this key still exist. Furthermore, any existing copy might not be functional anymore, since many old keys are said to have been disabled with the [[Updates/8.0|Summer Update 2007]]. 

It's also not known for sure what material it was made of, however, it's assumed to be Copper since other Kazordoon keys [[Key 3801|3801]] and [[Key 3802|3802]] are made of this material.
